Strategy name: 9400
Multi-Timeframe Scalping Strategy (Long Index 7 + Short Index 907)

================================================================================
OVERVIEW
================================================================================
This is a multi-timeframe scalping strategy that combines:
- Long Entry: Condition Index 7 (Scalp Multi-Timeframe Strategy - Long)
- Short Entry: Condition Index 907 (Scalp Multi-Timeframe Strategy - Short)

The strategy identifies squeeze/consolidation patterns on 15m timeframe and 
enters on breakouts confirmed by volume and momentum on 5m timeframe, with 
overall trend confirmation from 1h timeframe.

================================================================================
STRATEGY LOGIC - LONG ENTRY (Index 7)
================================================================================

Step 1: H1 Uptrend Confirmation
---------------------------------
Confirms bullish trend on 1h timeframe using RSI indicators.

Conditions:
  • RSI_14_1h > buy_condition_7_rsi_1h_min (default: 55)
  • scalp_rsi_1h > buy_condition_7_scalp_rsi_1h_min (default: 55)
  • scalp_rsi_1h < buy_condition_7_scalp_rsi_1h_max (default: 80)  [Not overbought]

Step 2: M15 Squeeze Detection
-------------------------------
Identifies consolidation/squeeze zones on 15m timeframe with low volatility.

Conditions:
  • scalp_bbw_15m <= scalp_bbw_min_15m  [BBW in lower 20% of recent range]
  • volume < (scalp_vol_ma_15m * buy_condition_7_volume_15m_factor)  [default: 0.8]
    [Low volume confirmation - uses 5m volume compared to 15m MA]

Step 3: M5 Breakout Confirmation
----------------------------------
Confirms breakout on 5m timeframe with volume surge.

Conditions:
  • close > scalp_bb_upper_5m  [Price breaks above upper Bollinger Band]
  • volume > (scalp_vol_ma_5m * buy_condition_7_volume_5m_factor)  [default: 1.7]
    [Volume spike confirmation]

Step 4: M5 Momentum Confirmation
----------------------------------
Validates momentum but ensures not overbought.

Conditions:
  • scalp_rsi_5m > buy_condition_7_rsi_5m_min (default: 55)
  • scalp_rsi_5m < buy_condition_7_rsi_5m_max (default: 75)  [Not overbought]

Protections:
  • num_empty_288 <= allowed_empty_candles_288
  • protections_long_global == True


================================================================================
STRATEGY LOGIC - SHORT ENTRY (Index 907)
================================================================================

Step 1: H1 Downtrend Confirmation
-----------------------------------
Confirms bearish trend on 1h timeframe using RSI indicators (inverted from long).

Conditions:
  • RSI_14_1h < short_condition_907_rsi_1h_max (default: 45)  [Bearish momentum]
  • scalp_rsi_1h < short_condition_907_scalp_rsi_1h_max (default: 45)
  • scalp_rsi_1h > short_condition_907_scalp_rsi_1h_min (default: 20)  [Not oversold]

Step 2: M15 Squeeze Detection
-------------------------------
Same as long - identifies consolidation zones on 15m timeframe.

Conditions:
  • scalp_bbw_15m <= scalp_bbw_min_15m  [BBW in lower 20% of recent range]
  • volume < (scalp_vol_ma_15m * short_condition_907_volume_15m_factor)  [default: 0.8]
    [Low volume confirmation - uses 5m volume compared to 15m MA]

Step 3: M5 Breakdown Confirmation
-----------------------------------
Confirms breakdown on 5m timeframe with volume surge (inverted from long).

Conditions:
  • close < scalp_bb_lower_5m  [Price breaks below lower Bollinger Band]
  • volume > (scalp_vol_ma_5m * short_condition_907_volume_5m_factor)  [default: 1.7]
    [Volume spike confirmation]

Step 4: M5 Momentum Confirmation
----------------------------------
Validates bearish momentum but ensures not oversold (inverted from long).

Conditions:
  • scalp_rsi_5m < short_condition_907_rsi_5m_max (default: 45)
  • scalp_rsi_5m > short_condition_907_rsi_5m_min (default: 25)  [Not oversold]

Protections:
  • num_empty_288 <= allowed_empty_candles_288
  • protections_short_global == True
  • global_protections_short_pump == True
  • global_protections_short_dump == True


