================================================================================
STRATEGY CHARACTERISTICS
================================================================================

Timeframe: 5m (base)
Strategy Type: Scalping / Breakout
Trend Following: Yes (with 1h trend filter)
Counter-Trend: No

Key Features:
  • Multi-timeframe confirmation (1h trend, 15m squeeze, 5m breakout)
  • Volume-based confirmation
  • Bollinger Band squeeze detection
  • RSI momentum filters
  • Symmetrical logic for long and short entries
  • Risk management with ATR-based stops available

Best Used For:
  • High volatility markets
  • Pairs with clear trends
  • Active trading during high volume sessions
  • Futures trading (supports both spot and futures)


================================================================================
IMPLEMENTATION NOTES
================================================================================

1. This strategy requires accurate multi-timeframe data merging
2. The 15m squeeze detection uses a 100-candle lookback for BBW percentile
3. Volume comparisons use 5m volume against 15m volume MA
4. All indicators use pandas_ta (pta) library
5. Strategy includes global protection mechanisms
6. ATR indicator (scalp_atr_5m) is available for stop loss calculations

